    <hediffClass>XylXenos.Hediff_BioRejection</hediffClass>
    <label>bio-rejection</label>
    <description>Suffering from a severe allergic reaction to an artificial body part or implant. The only way to stop the reaction is to remove the artificial part or parts.</description>
